 扳机修复, 按键修复等</p>\n<h1 id=\"相关内容\"><a href=\"#相关内容\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"相关内容\"></a>相关内容</h1><iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://query.carlzeng.com/appsearch?q=掌机\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<h1 id=\"实现方法\"><a href=\"#实现方法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实现方法\"></a>实现方法</h1><p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200216929.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200216929\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200322635.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200322635\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200258674.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200258674\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200342434.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200342434\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200410957.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200410957\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200438698.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200438698\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200459148.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200459148\"></p>\n<h1 id=\"AOKZOE掌机摇杆校正教程\"><a href=\"#AOKZOE掌机摇杆校正教程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"AOKZOE掌机摇杆校正教程\"></a>AOKZOE掌机摇杆校正教程</h1><p>How to calibrate your AOKZOE A1’s Joysticks</p>\n<h1 id=\"AOKZOE-A1-Pro’s-Joysticks-calibration\"><a href=\"#AOKZOE-A1-Pro’s-Joysticks-calibration\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"AOKZOE A1 Pro’s Joysticks calibration\"></a>AOKZOE A1 Pro’s Joysticks calibration</h1><ol>\n<li><p>Press “BACK” + “START” button 5 seconds </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>When the LED to the right of the keyboard button lights up, release your finger. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The LED blinks twice and then becomes solid. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Do not stop the left and right joysticks and turn them around 360 degrees 2-3 times. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>When you’ve turned it enough, release your finger. After 1-2 seconds, the LED will turn off. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Congratulations. Calibration is complete.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>长按按键：长按左上角“BACK”按键 5 秒，直到右侧下方指示灯常亮。</p>\n<p>开始旋转：必须等指示灯常亮时，才能开始旋转摇杆。</p>\n<p>最大化旋转：快速且轻柔地将两边摇杆推到最外圈，最大化完整旋转几圈。</p>\n<p>完成退出：等待指示灯熄灭，即代表校准结束，可以正常使用。</p>\n<p>1、长按左上角“BACK”按键5秒，直到右侧下方指示灯常亮</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://aokzoe.com/uploads/allimg/220929/1-2209291K202B0.jpg\" alt=\"img\"></p>\n<p>2、指示灯常亮（一定要常亮时才旋转摇杆）</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://aokzoe.com/uploads/allimg/220929/1-2209291K223T3.jpg\" alt=\"img\"></p>\n<p>3、指示灯常亮后快速轻柔的最大化旋转两边摇杆</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://aokzoe.com/uploads/allimg/220929/1-2209291K303496.jpg\" alt=\"img\"></p>\n<p>4、一直最大幅度旋转2边的摇杆直至主机右下角指示灯灭就可以了</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://aokzoe.com/uploads/allimg/220929/1-2209291K3251b.jpg\" alt=\"img\"></p>\n<p>可以正常使用了</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://aokzoe.com/uploads/allimg/220929/1-2209291K352601.jpg\" alt=\"img\"></p>\n<p>GIF示意图</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://aokzoe.com/uploads/allimg/220929/1-2209291K94VY.gif\" alt=\"img\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aokzoe.com/fuwu/faq/10.html\">AOKZOE掌机摇杆校正教程</a></p>\n<h1 id=\"其他掌机\"><a href=\"#其他掌机\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"其他掌机\"></a>其他掌机</h1><h2 id=\"奥丁掌机的摇杆校准和按键测试\"><a href=\"#奥丁掌机的摇杆校准和按键测试\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"奥丁掌机的摇杆校准和按键测试\"></a>奥丁掌机的摇杆校准和按键测试</h2><p>奥丁掌机, 用来做portal, 用来串流非常好</p>\n<p>校准的摇杆和按键测试, 可以在安卓系统的设置中, 找到菜单项: 按键测试, 摇杆校准</p>\n<h2 id=\"OneXplayer掌机的摇杆校准\"><a href=\"#OneXplayer掌机的摇杆校准\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"OneXplayer掌机的摇杆校准\"></a>OneXplayer掌机的摇杆校准</h2><p>壹号掌机Windows掌机  PC掌机 <em>掌上游戏机</em> 深圳市壹号本科技游戏公司.</p>\n<p>OneXPlayer飞行家F1、OneXPlayer壹号游侠X1 AMD版、OneXPlayer壹号游侠X1英特尔版、OneXPlayer壹号游侠X1mini。其中OneXPlayer飞行家F1是纯掌机形态，而其余三款可以看作兼备掌机形态的三合一迷你平板</p>\n<p>OnexPlayer 1 是无法校准摇杆的, 不支持.</p>\n<p>OnexPlayer 2 壹号掌机的摇杆校准可以通过组合键手动进入校准模式完成。</p>\n<p>手动校准步骤</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>进入模式</strong>：在手柄默认状态下，同时长按 <strong>【Back】键 + 【Start】键</strong> 5秒左右，直到 RGB 灯熄灭或闪烁进入校准状态。</li>\n<li><strong>校准摇杆</strong>：将左、右摇杆以最大倾斜角度轻轻地<strong>顺时针&#x2F;逆时针旋转 3 圈以上</strong>（保持最大倾斜度，动作放轻）。</li>\n<li><strong>校准扳机</strong>：将左、右扳机键按到底并完全松开<strong>3次</strong>（确保行程完整）。</li>\n<li><strong>退出保存</strong>：按 <strong>【Y】键</strong> 或等待灯光状态恢复（部分型号旋转&#x2F;操作完毕后灯光熄灭即代表自动保存退出）。</li>\n</ol>\n","more":"<div> \n<button onclick=\"synthesizeSpeech()\">朗读全文</button>\n</div>\n<audio controls id=\"audioPlayer\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio>      \n<script>\n  function synthesizeSpeech() { \n    var inputText = document.getElementsByClassName('post-block')[0].innerText;\n    var voice = \"ZH\";\n    var url = 'https://tts.carlzeng.com:3/speech?text=' + encodeURIComponent(inputText.substring(0,3000)) + '&voice=' + voice;\n    var audioPlayer = document.getElementById('audioPlayer');          \n    audioPlayer.src = url;\n    audioPlayer.load();\n    audioPlayer.play();\n  }\n</script>\n\n<p>同样适用于: 更换肩键微动, 扳机修复, 按键修复等</p>\n<h1 id=\"相关内容\"><a href=\"#相关内容\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"相关内容\"></a>相关内容</h1><iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://query.carlzeng.com/appsearch?q=掌机\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<h1 id=\"实现方法\"><a href=\"#实现方法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实现方法\"></a>实现方法</h1><p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200216929.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200216929\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200322635.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200322635\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200258674.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200258674\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200342434.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200342434\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200410957.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200410957\"></p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260728200438698.png\" alt=\"image-20260728200438698\">